Skipping pytest invocation to avoid disturbing the user's running homelab-mcp.
The uvx --help / --version above counts as an instantiation of the package: uvx
resolves the package, downloads it if not cached, and invokes its entry point.
This means BEFORE/AFTER diff captures any state created by package install + entry-point startup,
but NOT necessarily state created by an MCP stdio session (which loads tool registry).
This caveat is documented in FINDINGS.md Open Questions.

